+// rcSend is a LAUNCHER envelope (kind GDAKI_CTRL_K_LAUNCHER, its ackSeq this rank's consumed count of that launcher's
+// messages, the page's rxConsumedL[li]) on that record QP. Received LAUNCHER and launcher PAIR envelopes come back
+// through gdakiCtrlLauncherOnEnvelope. The ring's peer list holds ranks only today (impl/notes_p2.md "phase 3가 부를 짝
+// 맺기 API"); its UD receive drops a launcher's datagram (badDgrams).
